   1, 'Which section of the cash flow statement captures the cash a business generates from its core operations?',
   jsonb_build_array('Investing activities','Financing activities','Operating activities','Discontinued operations'),
   2, 'Cash from operations reflects cash generated by the day-to-day business, after working-capital adjustments to net income.',
